sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Agent (alice)
  participant P as Pipeline (L2)
  participant G as Gates
  participant U as L3 → Anthropic
  A->>P: "Summarise Goldman Sachs Q3 results"
  P->>G: auth (key sk-proxy-alice)
  G-->>P: ALLOW + context.identity = alice
  P->>G: is_model_allowed (claude-sonnet-5-5)
  G-->>P: ALLOW
  P->>G: budget_check (worst case $0.0051)
  G-->>P: ALLOW, reserved $0.0051
  P->>G: word_filter (1 of 3): "SLUR" → deny
  G-->>P: ALLOW
  P->>G: word_filter (2 of 3): "kill" → deny, whole word
  G-->>P: ALLOW
  P->>G: word_filter (3 of 3): "Goldman Sachs" → mask as "Firm"
  G-->>P: MODIFY: "Summarise Firm Q3 results"
  Note over P,G: masked text = new input for the next gates
  P->>G: jev_eval (masked text)
  G-->>P: ALLOW, score 3%
  P->>U: forward the MODIFIED request
  U-->>P: answer: "Goldman Sachs reported..."
  P->>G: response: word_filter "Goldman Sachs" mask
  G-->>P: MODIFY: "Firm reported..."
  P->>G: response: budget_settle (real usage)
  G-->>P: ALLOW, charged $0.0012, released the rest
  P-->>A: answer + audit record (9 gate decisions, v12)
  Note over A,G: if any gate says DENY: stop there, return an error the SDK understands, write the audit record
